+- Setup establishes the canonical project locations and existing security/tenancy conventions before any test or source changes.
+- All three behavior tests must be written and observed failing before the migration, verifier, service, or route work begins.
+- The migration blocks the idempotent service; the verifier and service block the callback route; both routes block integration wiring.
+- Integration wiring and local verification are final tasks; local verification must not be represented as story validation.
